 {{Spellunit
| name = Homing Missile
| desc0 = The missile is uncontrollable.<br><br>It stays stationary 150-distance in front of Gyrocopter, and has a launch delay.

| icon1 = Phased wikiasset
| type1 = bsc
| target1 = Passive
| desc1 = {{Show|A|Homing Missile|Phase Movement|desc0}}

| icon2 = Creep Factor
| type2 = alticon
| target2 = Passive
| desc2 = Creeps do not attack the Homing Missile.}}

* The {{U|Homing Missile}} additionally has the following properties:
** {{Symbol|Projectile|Travel}}
*** Leveling up ability does not update the current airborne missile {{M|projectiles}}.
*** Switches to another nearest valid enemy unit within {{#var:Homing Missile basic1}} radius, prioritizing heroes, upon the primary {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy's {{M|death}}.
*** Although the Homing Missile neither grants {{M|vision}} nor {{M|True Sight}} over the target, the missile homes and impacts {{M|invisible}} enemy units.
*** {{cf|shdnotes}}
**** {{ValueColor||{{#var:Homing Missile type2 value2 shd}}|shd}} second after casting, the missile applies {{A|Gyrocopter|Rocket Barrage}} of its corresponding level within {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{ValueColor||{{#var:Homing Missile type2 value1 shd}}|shd}} radius, centered around itself, and prioritizes the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy.
***** Acquiring the {{M|Aghanim's Shard|text=ability upgrade}} immediately updates all current Homing Missiles.
***** The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} applied is sourced to Gyrocopter.
**** Works independently of Rocket Barrage's {{M|cooldown}}, and does not cost {{M|mana}}.
**** Does not proc {{M|on-cast effects}}.
** {{Symbol|Kill|Instant}}
*** The following sources [[instant kill]] the Homing Missile:
**** When there are no valid enemy units to home into upon the primary {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy's {{M|death}}.
**** {{I|Force Boots}}
**** {{A|Faceless Void|Chronosphere}}
** {{Symbol|Projectile|Speed}}
*** The [[projectile speed]] increases by 1 per {{#expr:1/{{#var:Homing Missile type1 value2}} round2}}-second intervals.
*** The speed acceleration has no limit, and continue to increase until it hits the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy or is destroyed.
** {{Symbol|fx|v}}
*** The cross-hair over the target is visible ally-only.
** {{Symbol|Forced Movement}}
*** The missile cannot impact the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy while being affected by valid [[forced movement]] sources.
**** In this situation, the missile passes through, reorients, and continues to chase its target.
*** Can only be affected by the following forced movement sources:
**** {{I|Force Staff}}
**** {{I|Hurricane Pike}}
**** {{I|Psychic Headband}}

* {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
** Only the following enemy units' attacks can damage the Homing Missile:
*** Considers {{M|clones}}' and {{M|illusions}}' attacks as hero attacks.
*** The {{M|Fountain}}.
*** {{M|Towers}}

* {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}}
** The ability effects are applied as follows upon projectile impact:
**# {{Symbol|Stun}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|[[stun]]ned}}
**# {{Symbol|Vision|Flying}}
**#* Grants a 3.5-second 400-radius [[flying vision]] over the stunned unit.
**# The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}}.
**# {{Symbol|Modifier|Stack}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
**#* Applies 1 {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{A|Gyrocopter|Afterburner}} stack.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Homing Missile icon0}}
| desc = Fires a homing missile to seek the targeted enemy unit. The missile gains speed over time, dealing damage and stunning when it impacts the target. Enemy units can destroy the missile before it reaches its target.
}}
* {{cf|shdnotes}} Directly use {{A|Gyrocopter|Rocket Barrage}}'s ability values.
** Does nothing if Rocket Barrage is not learned upon cast regardless of the {{M|Aghanim's Shard|text=ability upgrade}} animations.

